{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51270","headline":"兴唐寺 · 李白","name":"兴唐寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（在歙县郡城练水西，唐至德二年建。\n宋太平举国中勅改太平举国寺。\n）天台国清寺，天下称四绝。\n我来举唐游，於中更无别。\n枿木划断云，高峯顶积雪。\n槛外一条溪，几回流碎月。\n（康熙《徽州府志》十八《寺观》。\n○今按：此诗与前篇，异地异题，辗转汉传，各有可取之处。\n《苕溪渔隐》所引，应即此一篇之末二句。\n王琦未见此篇，不得称《渔隐》以爲《题水西寺》断句爲讹。\n〖宋朱弁《曲洧旧闻》卷八谓此诗石刻在歙溪西太平寺。\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}